{"id":"n23902-1-10","stage":4,"title":"개그 · 搞笑","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23902-1-10-1","ko":"대체 뭘 보길래 그렇게 웃는 거야?","zh":"你到底在看什么，笑得那么开心啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"대체","meaning":"到底、究竟","explanation":"대체：到底、究竟。","readings":[{"term":"대체","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:대체:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"대체","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대체","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"보길래","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；길래：说明说话人据以采取行动的原因或发现。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보길래","audio":"/audio/a67ea65d4490bc8c8380.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"웃는","meaning":"笑","explanation":"웃다：笑；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"웃다","audio":"/audio/1b049ea27ec195c92325.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71461","senseId":"1","lemma":"웃다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"웃는","audio":"/audio/f4c5acb77e38daed3281.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、行为或情况（것 的口语形式）","explanation":"거 是 것 的口语形式，把前面的修饰内容概括为事物、行为或情况。这里不表示指示代词“那个”；具体的时态、疑问或推测语气结合前后的语尾理解。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"baa66ff689021a3f","term":"대체","zh":"到底、究竟","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3","definition":"用于疑问句，加强追问或惊讶的语气。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"1b049ea27ec195c9","term":"웃다","zh":"笑","audio":"/audio/1b049ea27ec195c92325.mp3","entryId":"71461","definition":"高兴、满意或好笑时，解颜或发出声音。","pronunciation":["욷ː따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、行为或情况","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、行为或情况","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/36e8406fe42f2740b89b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23902-1-10-2","ko":"개그 프로그램인데 정말 재미있어.","zh":"这是搞笑节目，真的很好看呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"개그","meaning":"搞笑，逗乐","explanation":"개그：搞笑，逗乐。","readings":[{"term":"개그","audio":"/audio/f2949c7e388a0aec89f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23902","senseId":"1","lemma":"개그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개그","audio":"/audio/f2949c7e388a0aec89f3.mp3"}},{"text":"프로그램인데","meaning":"节目，节目单","explanation":"프로그램：节目，节目单；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"프로그램","audio":"/audio/f5044b9ba86548c9549b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60621","senseId":"2","lemma":"프로그램","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"프로그램인데","audio":"/audio/83b536f6dc47342cf5d5.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있어.","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있어","audio":"/audio/4b3c167acd6f1da7e9ac.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f2949c7e388a0aec","term":"개그","zh":"搞笑，逗乐","audio":"/audio/f2949c7e388a0aec89f3.mp3","entryId":"23902","definition":"在话剧或电视节目中，通过好笑的言语或行动使人发笑。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"f5044b9ba86548c9","term":"프로그램","zh":"节目，节目单","audio":"/audio/f5044b9ba86548c9549b.mp3","entryId":"60621","definition":"在广播、电视等里，按时间段播放的内容；或指其顺序或目录。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/57ae04378d65f74e64d4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.87,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=23902","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":138,"sequenceScore":2.6967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你到底在看什么，笑得那么开心啊？","这是搞笑节目，真的很好看呢。","这是哪儿飘来这么香的味道啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你到底在看什么，笑得那么开心啊？","这是搞笑节目，真的很好看呢。","这是哪儿飘来这么香的味道啊？"],"answer":1}]}
